      <description><![CDATA[<p>Read aloud speaks with voice mode&apos;s voice (#71). The play button on a message</p><p>now reads it in the language voice mode uses with the instance and the voice</p><p>chosen for it, as voice mode does, instead of the voice of the language it</p><p>detected in the text or the system voice when the voices lookup was slow.</p><p>Patch: an app behaviour fix. Gate: shaft gate budget passed on bbd69453</p><p>(template f02e2174), shared part 231 s.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/dgrassi1984/shaft/releases/tag/v0.82.2">Full release notes</a></p>]]></description>
